<mjml>
  <mj-head>
    <mj-attributes>
      <mj-all font-family="Arial, sans-serif" font-size="14px" color="#333333" line-height="22px" />
      <mj-text padding="10px 0" />
    </mj-attributes>
    <mj-style>
      ol { padding-left: 20px; margin: 10px 0; }
    </mj-style>
  </mj-head>
  <mj-body background-color="#f6f3f3">
    <!-- Main Content Container (600px width with 50px side padding) -->
    <mj-wrapper background-color="#ffffff" padding="0 50px">
      
      <!-- Header Image -->
      <mj-section padding="20px 0">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image src="images/Healthy Wealthy Skinny.png" alt="healthy-wealthy-skinny" align="center" padding="0" />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Intro Section -->
      <mj-section padding="10px 0">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">What's up</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Nesciunt recusandae ratione in veritatis maxime hic facere autem id consectetur tenetur!</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Non enim quo quia molestiae. Possimus eaque excepturi voluptatibus, voluptas autem praesentium soluta, quibusdam corporis, iure libero error impedit commodi ut ullam?</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Vero, quo!</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Subscribe, Like and Comment Section -->
      <mj-section padding="10px 0">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text font-size="16px" font-weight="bold">Subscribe, like and comment</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Lorem, ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Praesentium nihil ex a esse magni maiores, atque minus maxime blanditiis obcaecati.</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Dolorum, illo.</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Dolorum, illo.</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Lorem ipsum dolor sit, amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Dolorum, illo.</mj-text>
          <mj-text>
            <ol>
              <li>Lorem, ipsum.</li>
              <li>Lorem, ipsum.</li>
              <li>Lorem, ipsum.</li>
              <li>Lorem, ipsum.</li>
              <li>Lorem, ipsum.</li>
            </ol>
          </mj-text>
          <mj-text>Lorem ipsum dolor, sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Fugiat, recusandae!</mj-text>
          <mj-text>Lorem ipsum dolor, sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Fugiat, recusandae!</mj-text>
          <mj-image href="https://www.google.com" src="images/subscribe.png" alt="subscribe-button" align="left" padding="10px 0" />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Salutation -->
      <mj-section padding="10px 0">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text>Lorem, ipsum.</mj-text>
          <mj-text><a href="#" style="color: #007bff; text-decoration: underline;">none@none.com</a></mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Affiliate Link Disclosure -->
      <mj-section padding="10px 0">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text font-size="12px" color="#666666">Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit. Sed, molestiae!</mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Feature Image -->
      <mj-section padding="10px 0">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-image src="images/shawn and doggy.jpg" alt="shawn" padding="0" />
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

      <!-- Footer -->
      <mj-section padding="20px 0 30px 0">
        <mj-column>
          <mj-text align="center" font-size="12px" color="#666666">
            <a href="#" style="color: #666666; text-decoration: underline; margin-right: 15px;">Unsubscribe</a>
            <a href="#" style="color: #666666; text-decoration: underline; margin-right: 15px;">Update profile</a>
            <span>123 Anywhere USA</span>
          </mj-text>
        </mj-column>
      </mj-section>

    </mj-wrapper>
  </mj-body>
</mjml>